{"title": "Tharchiate Withering (Condition)", "pageid": 14758, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tharchiate_Withering_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tharchiate Withering Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Tharchiate Withering</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Your <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> score is reduced by 5 while cursed by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Tharchiate_Codex\" title=\"The Tharchiate Codex\">The Tharchiate Codex's</a> warped arcana. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\">Cursed</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CURSEDTOME_THARCHIATE_CODEX</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCURSEDTOME_THARCHIATE_CODEX%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCURSEDTOME_THARCHIATE_CODEX%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Cursed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Cursed\">SG_Cursed</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Curable via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/38px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/50px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remove Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\">Remove Curse</a>.</li>\n<li>Once cured, and after each <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a> thereafter, this condition is replaced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tharchiate_Vigour_(Condition)\" title=\"Tharchiate Vigour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tharchiate Vigour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tharchiate_Vigour_(Condition)\" title=\"Tharchiate Vigour (Condition)\">Tharchiate Vigour</a>.</li>\n<li>Can be negated by equipping <a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_Greater_Health\" title=\"Amulet of Greater Health\">Amulet of Greater Health</a> which sets your <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> score to 23 despite the effect of the curse. This amulet allows you to keep the curse and continue to sport the aesthetics of the curse from its accompanying sickly green aura without the health penalty.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Fiend\" title=\"The Fiend\">The Fiend</a> Warlocks especially might prefer the aesthetics of the curse over <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tharchiate_Vigour_(Condition)\" title=\"Tharchiate Vigour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tharchiate Vigour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tharchiate_Vigour_(Condition)\" title=\"Tharchiate Vigour (Condition)\">Tharchiate Vigour</a> considering <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_One%27s_Blessing\" title=\"Dark One's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/25px-Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/38px-Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/50px-Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dark One's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/25px-Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Dark_One%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_One%27s_Blessing\" title=\"Dark One's Blessing\">Dark One's Blessing</a> by this stage of the game provides comparable <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a> from every kill.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Tharchiate_Withering\">Sources of Tharchiate Withering</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Tharchiate_Codex\" title=\"The Tharchiate Codex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Tome_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Tharchiate_Codex\" title=\"The Tharchiate Codex\">The Tharchiate Codex</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195800\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2706/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32511/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11324/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐ex